_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607490/extras/31dd498b2929f281fead4fe350fc91d0.poster.avif?t=1766134808\" width=542 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607490/extras/31dd498b2929f281fead4fe350fc91d0.webm?t=1766134808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607490/extras/31dd498b2929f281fead4fe350fc91d0.mp4?t=1766134808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Mr. Billion</strong>, an idle life simulator where you can live like a true tycoon. Earn cash, climb the corporate ladder, and indulge in the lavish lifestyle of a billionaire. The dream is waiting—are you ready to live it?</p>",
